{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测Windows罕见SMB连接互联网。对应需求：数据外泄。官方：Rare SMB Connection to the Internet。","from":"now-9m","index":["logs-endpoint.events.network-*","winlogbeat-*","logs-windows.sysmon_operational-*","endgame-*","logs-m365_defender.event-*","logs-sentinel_one_cloud_funnel.*"],"language":"kuery","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】Windows罕见SMB连接互联网","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nWindows罕见SMB连接互联网\n\n### 为何重要\n把数据带出主机或网络\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对告警实体、进程/网络字段与时间窗。\n2. 核对是否符合变更窗口与已知业务工具。\n3. 关联同主机或同账号前后同类告警。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离相关主机或账号并排查落地与外连。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警。\n","references":["https://www.securify.nl/en/blog/living-off-the-land-stealing-netntlm-hashes/"],"risk_score":47,"rule_id":"f580bf0a-2d23-43bb-b8e1-17548bb947ec","severity":"medium","tags":["操作系统: Windows","主题: 数据外泄","来源: 默认","对应需求: 数据外泄"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"new_terms","query":"event.category:network and host.os.type:windows and process.pid:4 and\n  network.transport:tcp and destination.port:(139 or 445) and\n  source.ip:(\n    10.0.0.0/8 or\n    172.16.0.0/12 or\n    192.168.0.0/16\n  ) and\n  not destination.ip:(\n    10.0.0.0/8 or\n    127.0.0.0/8 or\n    169.254.0.0/16 or\n    172.16.0.0/12 or\n    192.0.0.0/24 or\n    192.0.0.0/29 or\n    192.0.0.8/32 or\n    192.0.0.9/32 or\n    192.0.0.10/32 or\n    192.0.0.170/32 or\n    192.0.0.171/32 or\n    192.0.2.0/24 or\n    192.31.196.0/24 or\n    192.52.193.0/24 or\n    192.168.0.0/16 or\n    192.88.99.0/24 or\n    224.0.0.0/4 or\n    100.64.0.0/10 or\n    192.175.48.0/24 or\n    198.18.0.0/15 or\n    198.51.100.0/24 or\n    203.0.113.0/24 or\n    240.0.0.0/4 or\n    \"::1\" or\n    \"FE80::/10\" or\n    \"FF00::/8\"\n  )\n","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标 Windows 主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**（按规则需要进程/网络/文件/注册表或安全日志）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1048","name":"Exfiltration Over Alternative Protocol","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1048/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0010","name":"Exfiltration","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0010/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1187","name":"Forced Authentication","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1187/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0006","name":"Credential Access","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0006/"}}],"new_terms_fields":["destination.ip"],"history_window_start":"now-7d","false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描"],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"endpoint","version":"*"},{"package":"windows","version":"*"},{"package":"m365_defender","version":"*"},{"package":"sentinel_one_cloud_funnel","version":"*"}],"investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","user.id","process.name","process.parent.name","process.executable","process.command_line","event.action","event.code","file.path","registry.path","source.ip","destination.ip","message"]},"version":215,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now"}
